{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09586","headline":"春遇南使贻赵知音 · 岑参","name":"春遇南使贻赵知音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端居春心醉，襟背思树萱。\n美人在南州，爲尔歌北门。\n北风吹烟物，戴胜鸣中园。\n枯杨长新条，芳草滋旧根。\n网丝结宝琴，尘埃被空樽。\n适遇江海信，聊与南客论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}